    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why i’m typing this. everything on paper is fine. i have the job, the apartment, my family is good... if anyone saw me they'd think i'm lucky. but it just feels like i'm walking through a thick gray fog every single day. nothing has color. nothing feels real. i'm just so incredibly tired of the emptiness.",
